<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Benchmark scores (%) for English with varying number and sampling of 25–400 languages during pretraining. <span id="A4.T9.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Num PT Langs</span> refers to the total number of languages included during pretraining. <span id="A4.T9.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Natural</span> and <span id="A4.T9.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Temp.</span> represent natural sampling and temperature-based sampling, respectively, both conducted with a fixed token budget of <math id="A4.T9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>100</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">100</annotation></semantics></math>B tokens. <span id="A4.T9.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">BB</span>, <span id="A4.T9.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">M3E</span>, <span id="A4.T9.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">XSC</span>, and <span id="A4.T9.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">XWG</span> denote the results for BeleBele, M3Exams, XStoryCloze, and XWinogrande respectively.</figcaption>
